        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 985/358BTN, 3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\" Plain Bearing, Square Corners Brass Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Omnia, the 3.5 x 3.5 Square Corners Brass Hinge with Button Tips is for use on wood or hollow metal residential doors. It is fitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia 985/358BTN 3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\" Residential Brass Hinge with Button Tips:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>For use on wood or hollow metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Removable Stainless Steel Pin</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI A2133 requirements for performance as well as screw hole and cutout locations.</li>\r\n<li>For doors 1-3/8\" thick up to 32\" wide.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with wood screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. 1 Hinge</i>\r\n</p>",
